WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 14=

5
02:03.680 --> 02:05.150
(To my esteemed father:)

6
02:05.870 --> 02:07.000
(I came to the capital to study,)

7
02:07.870 --> 02:09.080
(hoping to make a name for myself.)

8
02:11.000 --> 02:12.800
(But I met a wonderful woman,)

9
02:14.750 --> 02:15.840
(and we fell in love.)

10
02:18.750 --> 02:19.520
(I have no desire)

11
02:20.680 --> 02:21.590
(to join noble clans.)

12
02:22.960 --> 02:23.960
(A simple life with her)

13
02:24.840 --> 02:25.710
(would be sweeter than honey.)

14
02:26.870 --> 02:28.080
(If I make the list one day,)

15
02:28.430 --> 02:30.190
(I'll do my best to bring honor)

16
02:30.680 --> 02:31.520
(to our family.)

17
02:32.030 --> 02:34.430
(All I want is to marry the woman I love.)

18
03:31.520 --> 03:32.470
What's wrong?

19
03:32.870 --> 03:34.099
Don't... don't yell.

20
03:34.141 --> 03:35.451
I... I'm scared!

21
03:35.910 --> 03:36.560
Get out!

22
03:37.080 --> 03:37.750
Get out!

23
03:37.870 --> 03:38.310
Get out!

24
03:38.430 --> 03:38.819
I'm leaving!

25
03:38.861 --> 03:39.301
Get out!

26
03:39.560 --> 03:40.680
- Get out! - I need my shoes!

27
03:41.310 --> 03:42.259
- Get out! - I...

28
03:42.301 --> 03:43.021
- Get out! - Fine, I'll go barefoot!

29
03:43.840 --> 03:45.240
As if I forced you into this.

30
03:45.680 --> 03:47.000
Let your family explain it to you.

31
03:47.680 --> 03:48.400
Get out!

32
03:48.750 --> 03:49.430
I'm going!

33
03:49.590 --> 03:50.590
Get out!

34
04:14.560 --> 04:15.190
Chunhua.

35
04:15.560 --> 04:16.720
Chunhua, stop crying.

36
04:17.160 --> 04:18.870
The Prince of Jin really likes you.

37
04:19.600 --> 04:20.040
Chunhua,

38
04:20.360 --> 04:21.630
I know you're upset.

39
04:22.070 --> 04:24.000
But this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!

40
04:25.120 --> 04:26.720
I just want you to marry well.

41
04:27.390 --> 04:28.190
To be blunt,

42
04:29.000 --> 04:30.870
even if you want to be a maid,

43
04:31.070 --> 04:31.849
your brother can't spend

44
04:31.891 --> 04:33.651
his whole life hunting.

45
04:33.830 --> 04:34.809
Chunhua, listen to me...

46
04:34.851 --> 04:35.411
Get out!

47
04:35.800 --> 04:36.830
Get out!

48
04:37.510 --> 04:39.169
- Get out! - Chunhua, hear me out...

49
04:39.211 --> 04:40.381
Don't touch me!

50
04:40.720 --> 04:41.289
Get out!

51
04:41.331 --> 04:42.029
Quick! Let's go, Mother!

52
04:42.071 --> 04:42.594
Get out!

53
04:42.636 --> 04:43.106
All right...

54
04:43.430 --> 04:44.630
Get out!

55
05:08.270 --> 05:08.750
Your Highness,

56
05:09.070 --> 05:10.830
I didn't expect her to react so strongly.

57
05:11.680 --> 05:12.289
I'm sorry.

58
05:12.331 --> 05:12.771
Your Highness,

59
05:13.680 --> 05:15.190
Chunhua will come around.

60
05:15.560 --> 05:16.160
Yes, of course.

61
05:16.240 --> 05:16.950
Please, calm down.

62
05:17.430 --> 05:18.190
Have some more to drink.

63
05:18.270 --> 05:18.750
Yes.

64
05:19.310 --> 05:19.720
Chunhua.

65
05:20.750 --> 05:21.160
Chunhua!

66
05:22.040 --> 05:22.560
Chunhua!

67
05:23.310 --> 05:24.190
Where are you going?

68
05:24.750 --> 05:25.750
The Prince of Jin is still here!

69
05:28.240 --> 05:29.560
What a mess!

70
05:49.490 --> 05:52.890
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

71
05:53.220 --> 05:57.320
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

72
05:57.860 --> 06:01.850
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

73
06:01.900 --> 06:05.620
♪One moment too late, love slips from sight♪

74
06:06.420 --> 06:09.060
♪I've tasted the ache of wanting in vain♪

75
06:09.690 --> 06:14.020
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

76
06:14.490 --> 06:18.490
♪As darkness engulfs the palace and wildlands sway♪

77
06:18.540 --> 06:21.740
♪What can I do, with no one to light the way?♪

78
06:22.430 --> 06:22.920
Chunhua!

79
06:25.720 --> 06:26.190
Your Highness...

80
06:27.040 --> 06:27.600
Save me...

81
06:27.830 --> 06:28.360
Chunhua!

82
06:30.480 --> 06:31.920
I pushed them away and ran.

83
06:34.360 --> 06:35.190
The whole way,

84
06:36.720 --> 06:37.720
all I could do was run.

85
06:39.390 --> 06:41.240
My whole body felt numb.

86
06:42.870 --> 06:44.240
My legs didn't feel like my own.

87
06:45.310 --> 06:46.920
Neither did my arms.

88
06:48.190 --> 06:48.560
I...

89
06:53.000 --> 06:53.600
Chunhua.

90
06:54.800 --> 06:55.560
It's all right.

91
06:56.480 --> 06:57.190
You're back.

92
06:58.510 --> 06:59.720
You're back with me now.

93
07:02.560 --> 07:03.240
It's all right.

94
07:03.720 --> 07:04.310
Your Highness,

95
07:05.870 --> 07:06.750
I don't understand.

96
07:08.600 --> 07:10.480
They're my family.

97
07:11.720 --> 07:13.920
Why would they hurt me like that?

98
07:33.430 --> 07:33.950
Forget it.

99
07:36.720 --> 07:37.560
From now on,

100
07:39.310 --> 07:41.600
I'll consider my ties with them severed.

101
07:43.360 --> 07:44.480
That place

102
07:46.750 --> 07:48.600
is no longer my home.

103
07:50.360 --> 07:51.630
My home is here.

104
07:54.240 --> 07:55.430
I still have you, Your Highness.

105
07:56.360 --> 07:57.190
You still have me.

106
08:09.040 --> 08:09.870
Then promise me.

107
08:10.480 --> 08:11.390
You won't do anything foolish.

108
08:13.390 --> 08:14.070
Don't grieve or hurt yourself

109
08:15.310 --> 08:16.920
over those people.

110
08:17.680 --> 08:18.270
They're not worth it.

111
08:20.160 --> 08:20.830
Promise me.

112
08:27.240 --> 08:27.830
For the next few days,

113
08:29.720 --> 08:30.800
you can sleep in my room.

114
08:31.600 --> 08:32.480
Get some proper rest.

115
08:34.030 --> 08:35.000
Don't worry about anything.

116
08:35.510 --> 08:36.270
I'll stay with you.

117
08:38.360 --> 08:39.200
And you'll stay with me.

118
08:40.600 --> 08:41.080
All right?

119
09:43.870 --> 09:44.270
Your Highness,

120
09:44.720 --> 09:45.240
did you need me?

121
09:49.000 --> 09:49.360
Your Highness,

122
09:50.480 --> 09:51.270
how is Chunhua?

123
09:52.240 --> 09:53.440
She only just fell asleep.

124
09:55.120 --> 09:56.120
She cries even in her sleep.

125
10:02.840 --> 10:04.320
Take this letter to the Prince of Jin.

126
10:04.630 --> 10:05.480
Avoid the Princess Consort.

127
10:05.840 --> 10:06.910
Make sure it reaches him himself.

128
10:08.000 --> 10:08.550
Take this letter

129
10:09.270 --> 10:10.150
to Chunhua's family.

130
10:11.000 --> 10:11.910
If they can't read,

131
10:12.510 --> 10:13.420
read it aloud to them.

132
10:13.420 --> 10:14.260
(Tomorrow, your daughter will be married to the Prince of Jin.)

133
10:15.140 --> 10:15.780
Your Highness,

134
10:16.600 --> 10:18.030
you're hosting a banquet at Chunhua's home tomorrow

135
10:18.240 --> 10:19.120
and inviting the Prince of Jin

136
10:19.550 --> 10:20.510
to arrange the marriage yourself?

137
10:20.790 --> 10:21.080
Well...

138
10:21.240 --> 10:21.960
Just deliver the letters.

139
10:25.200 --> 10:25.510
Understood.

140
10:27.540 --> 10:32.380
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

141
11:20.060 --> 11:23.220
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

142
11:23.560 --> 11:27.860
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

143
11:28.260 --> 11:32.190
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

144
11:32.240 --> 11:35.710
♪One moment too late, love slips from sight♪

145
11:36.520 --> 11:39.690
♪I've tasted the ache of wanting in vain♪

146
11:41.510 --> 11:42.720
Liu Wenji came by today.

147
11:43.840 --> 11:46.550
He stood outside like a fool all day.

148
11:47.360 --> 11:48.630
He only left at curfew.

149
11:50.510 --> 11:51.670
If he comes again tomorrow,

150
11:53.750 --> 11:54.630
would you like to see him?

151
11:54.672 --> 11:58.642
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

152
11:59.250 --> 12:02.650
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

153
12:02.700 --> 12:04.580
♪Fate falls just short of granting our plea♪

154
12:04.630 --> 12:05.360
I'm like this...

155
12:05.402 --> 12:07.322
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

156
12:07.440 --> 12:08.240
How can I face him?

157
12:10.270 --> 12:10.840
Chunhua,

158
12:12.510 --> 12:13.270
listen to me.

159
12:14.550 --> 12:15.960
What happened wasn't your fault.

160
12:17.440 --> 12:19.440
Think of it as being bitten by a mangy dog

161
12:19.750 --> 12:20.630
or getting splattered with mud.

162
12:22.360 --> 12:23.840
Didn't I wash it all off you?

163
12:23.950 --> 12:26.890
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

164
12:27.600 --> 12:28.550
My Chunhua

165
12:29.150 --> 12:30.550
is still as adorable as ever.

166
12:31.510 --> 12:32.270
Just as beautiful.

167
12:39.480 --> 12:40.120
But I...

168
12:42.030 --> 12:42.630
I've already...

169
12:42.790 --> 12:43.360
Chunhua.

170
12:44.720 --> 12:45.720
You're still the same person.

171
12:48.240 --> 12:49.670
Never turn against yourself.

172
12:50.840 --> 12:52.080
And never punish yourself.

173
12:55.090 --> 12:59.060
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

174
12:59.110 --> 13:02.580
♪One moment too late, love slips from sight♪

175
13:03.690 --> 13:06.290
♪I've tasted the ache of wanting in vain♪

176
13:07.090 --> 13:11.220
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

177
13:11.720 --> 13:12.200
Your Highness...

178
13:12.242 --> 13:15.632
♪As darkness engulfs the palace and wildlands sway♪

179
13:16.270 --> 13:17.790
I never understood before

180
13:19.670 --> 13:20.910
how much pain you were in.

181
13:23.870 --> 13:25.200
But now I do.

182
13:26.100 --> 13:28.690
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

183
13:30.360 --> 13:31.510
It really hurts.

184
13:31.840 --> 13:34.110
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

185
13:34.600 --> 13:37.490
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

186
13:38.060 --> 13:42.290
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

187
13:42.560 --> 13:45.490
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

188
13:46.120 --> 13:48.340
♪May we lay sorrow down, then sleep apart in peace♪

189
13:48.390 --> 13:50.800
♪Each guarding silence through the years♪

190
13:50.850 --> 13:53.890
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

191
14:04.080 --> 14:05.240
You're heading out this early?

192
14:05.440 --> 14:05.960
Come with me.

193
14:06.200 --> 14:06.840
I'll explain on the way.

194
14:17.270 --> 14:18.480
If Wenji finds out...

195
14:19.390 --> 14:20.240
Without Chunhua's agreement,

196
14:21.480 --> 14:23.550
not a word of this must reach Liu Wenji!

197
14:29.440 --> 14:30.600
Your Highness is bringing a blade.

198
14:31.030 --> 14:31.840
Is it to intimidate them,

199
14:32.510 --> 14:33.670
or do you intend to draw blood?

200
14:34.870 --> 14:35.750
The Prince of Jin deserves to die.

201
14:37.360 --> 14:38.320
Chunhua's family

202
14:39.030 --> 14:40.150
are worse than beasts.

203
14:41.870 --> 14:43.440
I won't let them get away.

204
14:46.630 --> 14:47.000
All right.

205
14:48.390 --> 14:49.480
Whatever you plan to do,

206
14:49.960 --> 14:51.080
I'll go with you.

207
14:51.790 --> 14:52.870
I know what you're worried about.

208
14:54.840 --> 14:55.360
Don't worry.

209
14:57.000 --> 14:58.440
I'll spare that beast's life.

210
15:21.000 --> 15:21.750
These refugees

211
15:22.960 --> 15:25.320
were likely driven from their homes

212
15:25.720 --> 15:26.600
by the Shence Army.

213
15:29.150 --> 15:30.480
Yu Cheng'an's hunting grounds

214
15:31.150 --> 15:33.000
may be far larger than we thought.

215
15:33.440 --> 15:34.840
Thousands of households are affected.

216
15:35.320 --> 15:36.910
His senior palace attendant, Zheng Xing,

217
15:37.630 --> 15:38.960
pledged to him

218
15:39.360 --> 15:42.000
to clear all farmland and homes within three months.

219
15:42.600 --> 15:43.870
It's already cost many lives.

220
15:44.270 --> 15:46.080
Yu Cheng'an has always acted this way.

221
15:47.080 --> 15:48.670
He never cares who lives or dies.

222
15:51.600 --> 15:52.630
Even in peacetime,

223
15:53.080 --> 15:54.440
people can barely make ends meet.

224
15:55.150 --> 15:57.000
Now they're losing even their homes.

225
15:58.150 --> 15:59.390
If this continues,

226
16:00.270 --> 16:01.390
there'll be serious trouble.

227
16:19.480 --> 16:19.960
Your Highness,

228
16:20.270 --> 16:22.670
we have nothing better

229
16:23.270 --> 16:24.200
to offer.

230
16:24.440 --> 16:26.240
Please, make do with this tea.

231
16:27.750 --> 16:28.600
My sister-in-law

232
16:29.000 --> 16:30.369
never brought back some decent tea

233
16:30.411 --> 16:31.931
from the Princess's place.

234
16:33.790 --> 16:34.720
Today,

235
16:35.150 --> 16:36.390
is Princess Danyang coming alone,

236
16:37.270 --> 16:39.320
or will Chunhua come too?

237
16:40.440 --> 16:41.150
Your Highness,

238
16:41.750 --> 16:43.750
the letter only said the Princess would come.

239
16:44.320 --> 16:45.510
It didn't mention Chunhua.

240
16:46.790 --> 16:49.790
That girl is probably hiding at the Princess's place,

241
16:50.480 --> 16:51.240
too shy to show her face.

242
16:52.550 --> 16:53.270
Exactly.

243
16:53.790 --> 16:55.360
She's been at the Princess's side,

244
16:55.630 --> 16:57.550
so she thinks she's nobility now.

245
16:57.630 --> 16:58.270
Putting on airs.

246
16:59.270 --> 16:59.600
Shut up!

247
17:03.030 --> 17:05.510
Your Highness, my... my wife means

248
17:05.720 --> 17:07.640
that with your favor,

249
17:08.000 --> 17:10.440
Chunhua feels like someone of high standing.

250
17:12.440 --> 17:12.830
Your Highness,

251
17:13.720 --> 17:15.529
when do you plan

252
17:15.571 --> 17:16.981
to bring Chunhua over?

253
17:22.110 --> 17:24.550
That depends on whether she knows her place

254
17:24.920 --> 17:27.160
and knows how to please me.

255
17:28.240 --> 17:29.160
Wildflowers are lovely,

256
17:29.960 --> 17:32.200
but there's no shortage of them.

257
17:33.880 --> 17:34.400
Your Highness,

258
17:34.680 --> 17:36.270
our flower has always been

259
17:36.640 --> 17:39.510
so thoughtful and understanding.

260
17:39.680 --> 17:41.000
Exactly!

261
17:45.790 --> 17:46.830
That's enough.

262
17:47.750 --> 17:48.750
I can't stomach it.

263
17:49.830 --> 17:50.750
It's awful!

264
17:59.200 --> 17:59.480
Wan...

265
18:00.000 --> 18:00.830
Wanyao, you're here.

266
18:01.880 --> 18:02.920
Is she Princess Danyang?

267
18:04.790 --> 18:05.480
Your Highness.

268
18:06.440 --> 18:06.769
Your Highness.

269
18:06.811 --> 18:07.371
Greetings.

270
18:09.240 --> 18:10.550
Now that everyone's here,

271
18:11.070 --> 18:11.790
wonderful.

272
18:19.790 --> 18:20.400
Don't bother looking.

273
18:20.720 --> 18:21.400
Chunhua isn't coming.

274
18:21.830 --> 18:23.070
She's cut ties

275
18:23.590 --> 18:24.640
with your entire family.

276
18:25.590 --> 18:27.720
I'm here to settle the score for her.

277
18:29.400 --> 18:31.769
We're family. What score is there to settle?

278
18:31.811 --> 18:32.221
Yes.

279
18:32.920 --> 18:34.640
Please bring Chunhua here.

280
18:34.960 --> 18:36.720
We can explain everything to her.

281
18:41.350 --> 18:41.750
Son!

282
18:41.920 --> 18:42.769
Are you all right?

283
18:42.811 --> 18:43.079
I'm fine.

284
18:43.121 --> 18:43.384
Oh...

285
18:43.426 --> 18:43.946
I'm fine.

286
18:44.070 --> 18:46.000
I know you don't understand what family means.

287
18:46.960 --> 18:48.270
Even the fiercest beast won't harm its own young.

288
18:49.160 --> 18:51.030
As Chunhua's closest family,

289
18:51.400 --> 18:52.640
you sold her off once

290
18:53.200 --> 18:54.440
as a servant.

291
18:54.790 --> 18:55.920
And now you want to sell her again.

292
18:56.240 --> 18:56.880
Again and again.

293
18:58.160 --> 18:58.510
Stop right there!

294
19:04.070 --> 19:04.440
Wan...

295
19:04.550 --> 19:06.160
Wanyao, I truly love Chunhua.

296
19:06.510 --> 19:07.219
Look...

297
19:07.261 --> 19:08.709
What's done is done.

298
19:08.751 --> 19:10.781
I'm not one to shirk my responsibilities.

299
19:11.240 --> 19:13.200
I've been meaning to discuss this with you.

300
19:13.440 --> 19:14.979
But... you were busy.

301
19:15.021 --> 19:15.851
I didn't want to disturb you.

302
19:15.960 --> 19:17.179
But I...

303
19:17.221 --> 19:18.499
Even if I can't take her into my residence,

304
19:18.541 --> 19:20.434
I can buy her a house elsewhere,

305
19:20.476 --> 19:22.586
and she can live comfortably.

306
19:27.480 --> 19:31.640
That hurts!

307
19:32.720 --> 19:33.680
Listen carefully.

308
19:34.550 --> 19:36.590
I have Chunhua's indenture.

309
19:37.160 --> 19:38.590
She's part of my household.

310
19:39.400 --> 19:40.480
Whether she marries or not,

311
19:40.680 --> 19:41.510
whether she stays or leaves,

312
19:41.830 --> 19:42.729
it's up to me.

313
19:42.771 --> 19:44.909
Yes... It's all up to you!

314
19:44.951 --> 19:46.104
I... I don't know

315
19:46.146 --> 19:47.306
why you're so angry.

316
19:47.440 --> 19:49.619
I thought she's just a maid...

317
19:49.661 --> 19:52.421
That hurts...

318
20:04.510 --> 20:05.640
Ti, you know

319
20:07.160 --> 20:08.590
ever since I returned from North Jing,

320
20:09.400 --> 20:10.440
I've become a madwoman.

321
20:11.270 --> 20:13.240
I can't stand the slightest provocation.

322
20:13.920 --> 20:14.960
I can't think straight.

323
20:15.400 --> 20:16.680
I just do whatever I feel like.

324
20:19.790 --> 20:20.310
What...

325
20:20.720 --> 20:21.640
What do you want to do?

326
20:21.920 --> 20:23.030
To be honest,

327
20:24.070 --> 20:27.160
I've been bottling up my anger.

328
20:27.400 --> 20:28.200
I couldn't take it anymore.

329
20:29.160 --> 20:30.350
I stabbed you today,

330
20:31.200 --> 20:31.960
and I feel much better.

331
20:32.350 --> 20:33.440
As long as you feel better...

332
20:34.030 --> 20:35.240
I hope you will

333
20:35.830 --> 20:37.110
keep your distance from Chunhua.

334
20:37.880 --> 20:39.240
If I catch you again,

335
20:41.270 --> 20:42.070
my sword

336
20:43.110 --> 20:44.510
won't miss.

337
20:52.640 --> 20:53.720
Ti, you've suffered.

338
20:55.920 --> 20:58.400
These commoners tried to murder a prince.

339
20:59.000 --> 20:59.790
What punishment do they deserve?

340
21:07.960 --> 21:08.590
Come on.

341
21:09.590 --> 21:11.310
You're a prince. You left without a scratch,

342
21:11.440 --> 21:12.440
then came back with a knife wound.

343
21:12.790 --> 21:14.160
Did you stab yourself?

344
21:18.160 --> 21:18.480
Yes!

345
21:19.720 --> 21:20.070
It's them!

346
21:20.590 --> 21:21.510
They stabbed me!

347
21:22.750 --> 21:23.240
I...

348
21:23.550 --> 21:24.750
Attempting to assassinate a prince

349
21:25.510 --> 21:26.510
means exile at best,

350
21:27.110 --> 21:28.070
execution at worst.

351
21:29.070 --> 21:30.000
Since you're the victim, Ti,

352
21:30.920 --> 21:32.000
you can press charges yourself.

353
21:33.680 --> 21:35.059
- We're innocent! - I'll go!

354
21:35.101 --> 21:35.634
No!

355
21:35.676 --> 21:37.637
We're innocent!

356
21:37.679 --> 21:38.748
- We're innocent! - We didn't kill anyone!

357
21:38.790 --> 21:39.239
I don't want to die!

358
21:39.281 --> 21:40.721
- Chunhua suffered far worse! - I don't want to die!

359
21:44.350 --> 21:44.790
Wanyao...

360
21:45.790 --> 21:46.920
Can I leave now?

361
21:47.750 --> 21:48.920
I'm bleeding...

362
21:51.680 --> 21:52.459
You can't leave, Your Highness!

363
21:52.501 --> 21:53.389
Your Highness!

364
21:53.431 --> 21:53.861
Your Highness!

365
21:53.960 --> 21:55.331
- You can't leave, Your Highness! - Don't go!

366
21:55.440 --> 21:57.499
- Your Highness, help us! - What will we do without you?

367
21:57.541 --> 21:58.994
- Come back, Your Highness! - Please save us!

368
21:59.036 --> 22:00.716
- Your Highness! - Your Highness!

369
22:04.160 --> 22:04.640
(Come out at once!)

370
22:05.240 --> 22:05.750
(Hurry!)

371
22:06.200 --> 22:06.510
(Quick!)

372
22:07.680 --> 22:09.640
What's going on?

373
22:11.400 --> 22:12.030
The Shence Army?

374
22:13.000 --> 22:13.830
What are they doing here?

375
22:15.030 --> 22:15.510
Your Highness,

376
22:16.790 --> 22:17.400
the Shence Army's here.

377
22:23.160 --> 22:24.000
Has your land also been marked

378
22:24.240 --> 22:25.270
for the hunting grounds?

379
22:28.200 --> 22:28.720
Answer him!

380
22:29.240 --> 22:30.240
Y-Yes!

381
22:31.510 --> 22:33.030
Your Highness...

382
22:33.310 --> 22:34.699
That hurts!

383
22:34.741 --> 22:35.131
Your Highness,

384
22:35.350 --> 22:37.240
you must protect my family!

385
22:37.350 --> 22:37.640
I...

386
22:39.920 --> 22:40.680
Your Highness.

387
22:41.000 --> 22:42.750
Three months ago, an official said

388
22:42.830 --> 22:44.920
our entire village'd become hunting grounds.

389
22:45.110 --> 22:46.899
My whole family entirely depends

390
22:46.941 --> 22:48.701
on this land and these mountains.

391
22:49.240 --> 22:51.030
We really have no other choice!

392
22:52.350 --> 22:52.790
Your Highness,

393
22:53.590 --> 22:55.550
now that you've slept with Chunhua,

394
22:56.000 --> 22:57.400
please, for Chunhua's sake,

395
22:57.550 --> 22:59.289
you... you must save our family!

396
22:59.331 --> 22:59.779
Your Highness!

397
22:59.821 --> 23:01.064
- Your Highness! - Save us!

398
23:01.106 --> 23:02.276
- Please save us! - That hurts!

399
23:02.640 --> 23:03.880
So this is why

400
23:04.240 --> 23:04.960
you sold Chunhua off?

401
23:06.310 --> 23:06.920
Your Highness...

402
23:07.110 --> 23:08.590
Your Highness, tell them that's not true.

403
23:09.160 --> 23:10.070
Cut the crap!

404
23:10.550 --> 23:11.510
What's wrong with you?

405
23:12.110 --> 23:13.310
I'm bleeding!

406
23:13.590 --> 23:14.880
Use your heads!

407
23:15.590 --> 23:16.790
Who... who would dare stop

408
23:17.160 --> 23:18.000
the man building hunting grounds?

409
23:19.000 --> 23:20.270
Just wait until you're exiled!

410
23:21.160 --> 23:22.070
I'm leaving.

411
23:22.440 --> 23:23.489
Wanyao, I'm off.

412
23:23.531 --> 23:25.021
- I'm going home for dinner... - Your Highness!

413
23:25.110 --> 23:25.809
Your Highness, hear me out!

414
23:25.851 --> 23:27.421
You can't leave, Your Highness...

415
23:30.440 --> 23:30.920
Your Highness!

416
23:31.160 --> 23:32.769
Your Highness, you care for Chunhua the most.

417
23:32.811 --> 23:34.091
Please, save our family!

418
23:34.270 --> 23:35.830
Your Highness!

419
23:42.070 --> 23:44.830
Search every inch of this place.

420
23:45.110 --> 23:46.249
Leave no one behind.

421
23:46.291 --> 23:47.131
Tie them all up!

422
23:47.640 --> 23:48.440
Line them up!

423
23:49.960 --> 23:50.400
Sir,

424
23:51.270 --> 23:52.640
looks like he's running away!

425
23:54.880 --> 23:57.000
It's been ages since I stretched my arms.

426
24:04.640 --> 24:05.400
Go check on him.

427
24:05.510 --> 24:05.859
Yes, sir!

428
24:05.901 --> 24:07.851
Let's see who dares pull this stunt.

429
24:12.200 --> 24:12.640
Run!

430
24:13.030 --> 24:13.750
Where are you running to?

431
24:14.750 --> 24:15.920
What scoundrel are you?

432
24:16.590 --> 24:18.030
How dare you shoot me!

433
24:18.480 --> 24:19.830
I'm the Prince of Jin!

434
24:21.550 --> 24:22.750
Oh, you're the Prince of Jin?

435
24:29.200 --> 24:29.960
Reporting.

436
24:30.680 --> 24:32.200
That man claims he's

437
24:32.790 --> 24:33.240
Prince of Jin.

438
24:41.680 --> 24:43.000
Everyone thinks they can bully me!

439
24:43.790 --> 24:44.158
(Oh, no!)

440
24:44.200 --> 24:45.110
Even a eunuch dares bully me!

441
24:45.152 --> 24:46.072
(He really is the Prince of Jin!)

442
24:46.590 --> 24:48.068
(What is he doing here?)

443
24:48.110 --> 24:50.680
I'll make the Emperor give me justice!

444
24:50.920 --> 24:51.400
Sir,

445
24:52.440 --> 24:54.270
could he really be the Prince of Jin?

446
24:54.680 --> 24:56.270
Today's just not my day.

447
24:57.590 --> 24:59.400
If he makes a fuss about this,

448
24:59.960 --> 25:01.510
and my godfather finds out,

449
25:02.350 --> 25:04.110
he'll never let me off easy.

450
25:04.510 --> 25:07.920
My whole future will be ruined.

451
25:10.880 --> 25:12.640
I say, since we're in the middle of nowhere,

452
25:12.750 --> 25:13.240
we should...

453
25:21.550 --> 25:23.590
Burn his body too.

454
25:23.750 --> 25:25.030
Leave no trace behind.

455
25:25.350 --> 25:25.680
Got it.

456
25:26.590 --> 25:26.920
Move!

457
25:33.070 --> 25:35.110
Are you taking me back to the palace?

458
25:35.270 --> 25:37.350
I... I can walk on my own!

459
25:38.270 --> 25:39.200
Mr. Zheng,

460
25:39.680 --> 25:41.489
please, have mercy!

461
25:41.531 --> 25:41.901
Sir,

462
25:42.440 --> 25:44.030
there are homes all around us.

463
25:44.310 --> 25:45.550
Someone might see it.

464
25:49.680 --> 25:50.920
Let's kill

465
25:51.270 --> 25:52.680
every last witness.

466
25:53.350 --> 25:53.640
Got it.

467
25:54.680 --> 25:54.960
Move!

468
25:58.110 --> 25:59.720
They're determined to silence everyone.

469
26:00.400 --> 26:00.790
Your Highness,

470
26:01.400 --> 26:02.440
I'll get you and Mr. Yan out of here.

471
26:03.240 --> 26:05.000
With this many troops, I doubt we can make it.

472
26:05.720 --> 26:06.160
Fang Tong,

473
26:07.310 --> 26:08.550
however mighty you are,

474
26:09.000 --> 26:10.270
you can't beat this many soldiers.

475
26:11.750 --> 26:12.400
If we fight our way out,

476
26:13.000 --> 26:14.110
all three of us will die here.

477
26:14.720 --> 26:15.350
Then what do we do?

478
26:16.160 --> 26:17.200
I shouldn't have agreed

479
26:17.720 --> 26:18.400
to bring you here.

480
26:18.640 --> 26:19.920
Now's no time for that!

481
26:21.550 --> 26:22.070
Right now,

482
26:23.310 --> 26:24.440
there may be only one way.

483
26:27.270 --> 26:27.680
Yan Shang,

484
26:30.000 --> 26:30.590
do you remember

485
26:31.440 --> 26:32.680
that embroidered picture of five fish?

486
26:34.030 --> 26:34.590
Today,

487
26:35.030 --> 26:36.030
I'll make the first move.

488
26:42.160 --> 26:42.720
(Zheng Xing,)

489
26:43.590 --> 26:44.638
(for the sake of these people's lives...)

490
26:44.680 --> 26:45.880
Thoroughly search the place again!

491
26:45.922 --> 26:47.548
(You must die today!)

492
26:47.590 --> 26:48.880
Leave no survivors!

493
26:54.240 --> 26:54.720
Sir!

494
26:56.640 --> 26:57.070
(Watch out!)

495
26:57.350 --> 26:57.880
(Stay alert!)

496
26:59.480 --> 26:59.735
(Sir?)

497
26:59.800 --> 27:00.220
(Sir?)

498
27:00.270 --> 27:00.529
Sir?

499
27:00.571 --> 27:00.941
Sir...

500
27:03.240 --> 27:04.030
(Don't panic, everyone!)

501
27:04.880 --> 27:05.350
They're inside the house.

502
27:06.200 --> 27:06.960
The criminal's in there!

503
27:07.240 --> 27:08.110
Seize them!

504
27:08.270 --> 27:08.590
Quick!

505
27:10.000 --> 27:10.400
Hurry!

506
27:13.240 --> 27:13.590
(Follow me!)

507
27:15.350 --> 27:15.920
(Over here!)

508
27:22.920 --> 27:23.880
(Who's in there?)

509
27:24.030 --> 27:24.510
(Come out!)

510
27:37.350 --> 27:38.070
You shot that arrow?

511
27:39.240 --> 27:39.550
Yes.

512
27:40.030 --> 27:40.510
It was me.

513
27:41.790 --> 27:42.240
Yan Shang!

514
27:46.960 --> 27:48.400
Zheng Xing was ruthless,

515
27:48.960 --> 27:49.790
preyed on the people.

516
27:50.200 --> 27:51.160
Killing him today

517
27:51.880 --> 27:53.070
was justice in Heaven's name.

518
27:54.480 --> 27:55.070
Very well!

519
27:55.790 --> 27:56.550
You all heard that?

520
27:57.400 --> 27:58.640
Seize this criminal!

521
27:58.790 --> 27:59.920
Avenge Mr. Zheng!

522
28:00.200 --> 28:00.510
Move!

523
28:00.790 --> 28:01.590
(Yes, sir!)

524
28:01.720 --> 28:02.680
I am Princess Danyang!

525
28:03.160 --> 28:03.920
Who dares to act recklessly?

526
28:08.640 --> 28:09.480
Zheng Xing is dead.

527
28:09.830 --> 28:11.200
If you dare lay a hand on me,

528
28:11.880 --> 28:12.960
do you want to join him in the grave?

529
28:16.110 --> 28:17.750
Today, I'll see for myself

530
28:18.480 --> 28:19.880
who dares to harm

531
28:21.400 --> 28:22.550
a member of the imperial family

532
28:23.200 --> 28:24.720
and risk having their entire clan wiped out!

533
28:29.200 --> 28:29.920
You few,

534
28:30.350 --> 28:31.510
what rank do you hold?

535
28:33.270 --> 28:34.270
Raising your weapons against me,

536
28:34.720 --> 28:35.920
are you attempting to assassinate me?

537
28:40.160 --> 28:42.400
We failed to recognize Your Highness.

538
28:42.790 --> 28:43.920
Please forgive us.

539
28:47.440 --> 28:48.160
However,

540
28:49.510 --> 28:52.030
this criminal has confessed to killing Mr. Zheng.

541
28:52.960 --> 28:54.000
Princess Danyang,

542
28:54.480 --> 28:55.550
are you trying to shield him?

543
29:00.880 --> 29:01.350
Your Highness,

544
29:02.110 --> 29:04.200
I must be the one who killed Zheng Xing.

545
29:05.270 --> 29:06.160
I can't save you,

546
29:06.590 --> 29:07.680
but you can save me.

547
29:09.030 --> 29:09.550
So,

548
29:10.590 --> 29:11.550
you must stay out of it.

549
29:13.070 --> 29:14.200
Remember, patience.

550
29:15.000 --> 29:15.750
That python

551
29:16.550 --> 29:17.680
has yet to bare its fangs.

552
29:24.160 --> 29:25.200
Then I'll ask Your Highness

553
29:26.070 --> 29:26.920
to see me off a little farther.

554
29:36.270 --> 29:37.000
Officers,

555
29:37.920 --> 29:38.440
I hereby

556
29:38.960 --> 29:39.680
turn myself in.

557
29:41.110 --> 29:41.640
I ask you all

558
29:42.310 --> 29:43.070
to escort me back

559
29:43.640 --> 29:44.750
to stand trial.

560
29:45.480 --> 29:45.830
Take him away!

561
29:46.550 --> 29:46.960
Yes, sir!

562
29:47.110 --> 29:47.590
How dare you!

563
29:49.160 --> 29:50.240
I'll escort him myself.

564
29:52.550 --> 29:53.480
How dare you lay a hand on him?

565
30:14.440 --> 30:15.720
Let it be known to all:

566
30:16.400 --> 30:17.480
I, Yan Shang,

567
30:18.160 --> 30:19.550
killed Zheng Xing today.

568
30:20.070 --> 30:22.270
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

569
30:23.110 --> 30:24.240
back to the city to surrender!

570
30:28.030 --> 30:33.070
(Thank you, hero!)

571
30:33.480 --> 30:33.960
(Thank you!)

572
30:34.240 --> 30:35.070
I, Yan Shang,

573
30:35.590 --> 30:37.070
killed Zheng Xing today.

574
30:37.750 --> 30:40.000
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

575
30:40.480 --> 30:41.550
back to the city to surrender!

576
30:42.590 --> 30:43.590
I, Yan Shang,

577
30:44.070 --> 30:45.440
killed Zheng Xing today.

578
30:46.110 --> 30:48.270
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

579
30:48.920 --> 30:49.960
back to the city to surrender!

580
30:51.020 --> 30:55.620
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

581
30:56.120 --> 30:59.320
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

582
31:00.290 --> 31:05.320
♪Dusk falls on the horizon, sorrow and joy stretch far♪

583
31:05.690 --> 31:08.920
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

584
31:10.260 --> 31:14.890
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

585
31:16.060 --> 31:18.420
(Well done!)

586
31:18.590 --> 31:24.719
(Well done!)

587
31:24.760 --> 31:26.615
(You're our benefactor!)

588
31:27.820 --> 31:30.315
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

589
31:30.357 --> 31:32.597
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

590
31:32.790 --> 31:35.310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

591
31:35.510 --> 31:38.310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

592
31:38.590 --> 31:44.422
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

593
31:44.422 --> 31:48.310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

594
31:48.310 --> 31:52.198
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

595
31:52.198 --> 31:58.030
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

596
31:58.550 --> 32:01.480
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

597
32:01.590 --> 32:04.750
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

598
32:05.310 --> 32:08.000
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

599
32:08.760 --> 32:11.240
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

600
32:13.092 --> 32:17.210
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

601
32:17.252 --> 32:22.282
♪Frost on my shoulders, joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

602
32:22.570 --> 32:25.800
♪A thousand miles of lights keep me company♪

603
32:27.140 --> 32:31.770
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

604
32:32.170 --> 32:35.300
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

605
32:40.700 --> 32:41.540
(By Lord Yu's order,)

606
32:42.030 --> 32:43.060
(as this case concerns the hunting grounds,)

607
32:43.660 --> 32:45.900
(the murder suspect must not be taken to the Capital Prefecture!)

608
32:46.540 --> 32:48.790
(The Yintaimen Investigation Office will handle the case.)

609
32:49.440 --> 32:49.880
(Take him away!)

610
32:50.400 --> 32:50.790
(Yes, sir!)

611
33:25.270 --> 33:27.160
I should've checked my luck.

612
33:27.240 --> 33:28.310
It hurts like hell...

613
33:33.240 --> 33:34.550
Wh-why are you coming to me again?

614
33:35.070 --> 33:36.720
You nearly died at Zheng Xing's hands today.

615
33:37.200 --> 33:38.350
Do you know how you survived?

616
33:39.790 --> 33:42.110
Wanyao, I... passed out from the pain.

617
33:42.480 --> 33:43.550
I have no idea.

618
33:44.030 --> 33:46.750
Yan Shang, the Third-Place Scholar, shot Zheng Xing.

619
33:46.920 --> 33:47.590
He saved your life.

620
33:48.640 --> 33:49.160
Now,

621
33:49.550 --> 33:51.110
he's been sent to the Yintaimen Investigation Office.

622
33:53.440 --> 33:54.070
The Investigation Office?

623
33:55.640 --> 33:57.350
That's no place for a human being.

624
33:58.160 --> 33:59.550
No one comes out of there unscathed.

625
34:00.310 --> 34:00.790
Ti,

626
34:01.400 --> 34:02.640
you must testify in his defense.

627
34:03.590 --> 34:05.590
Today, Zheng Xing tried to silence you.

628
34:05.960 --> 34:06.880
Yan Shang was saving you.

629
34:09.110 --> 34:09.550
No!

630
34:10.150 --> 34:10.760
My leg...

631
34:11.590 --> 34:12.710
was hurt by that family.

632
34:14.630 --> 34:16.000
Zheng Xing had nothing to do with it.

633
34:16.760 --> 34:17.150
Tomorrow,

634
34:17.880 --> 34:19.110
I'll have the authorities arrest them

635
34:19.510 --> 34:20.280
and exile them all!

636
34:23.000 --> 34:23.480
Wanyao,

637
34:24.400 --> 34:26.630
if Lord Yu finds out, there'll be hell to pay.

638
34:27.320 --> 34:28.800
I advise you to stay out of it, too.

639
34:29.590 --> 34:31.510
You think Yintaimen care about right and wrong?

640
34:32.360 --> 34:33.440
Maybe Yan Shang just wants

641
34:33.550 --> 34:34.800
to die for a noble cause

642
34:35.190 --> 34:36.190
and make a name for himself.

643
34:40.320 --> 34:41.150
You're right.

644
34:44.110 --> 34:44.710
Your injury

645
34:45.440 --> 34:46.590
was caused by that family.

646
34:49.320 --> 34:50.440
Your wife has always been jealous.

647
34:51.190 --> 34:52.000
If she finds out

648
34:52.880 --> 34:53.840
you left the city in disguise

649
34:54.070 --> 34:55.190
just to chase after a woman...

650
34:56.190 --> 34:56.760
Wanyao,

651
34:57.440 --> 34:58.590
my dear sister,

652
35:00.710 --> 35:01.360
since you won't

653
35:02.030 --> 35:03.110
let me have Chunhua,

654
35:03.510 --> 35:05.150
this stays between us.

655
35:05.510 --> 35:07.190
Don't let my wife find out, all right?

656
35:07.590 --> 35:08.630
If you refuse to testify,

657
35:09.000 --> 35:10.030
she will definitely find out!

658
35:10.550 --> 35:10.840
You...

659
35:15.280 --> 35:16.070
You little brat!

660
35:16.920 --> 35:18.480
You're truly vicious!

661
35:19.030 --> 35:20.400
Go tell her, then!

662
35:21.110 --> 35:22.440
Even if she claws my face off

663
35:23.280 --> 35:24.400
and tears my hair out,

664
35:25.440 --> 35:26.710
I still won't testify!

665
35:28.440 --> 35:30.800
He killed Lord Yu's trusted aide!

666
35:34.670 --> 35:37.630
That hurts!

667
35:39.000 --> 35:41.030
Wanyao, I know you're upset.

668
35:42.070 --> 35:43.440
Go tell her, then!

669
35:44.960 --> 35:45.590
Hit me if you want!

670
35:46.630 --> 35:48.840
It's still better than crossing Lord Yu.

671
35:49.630 --> 35:50.280
Crossing him

672
35:51.030 --> 35:52.280
is as good as death!

673
35:53.000 --> 35:53.400
Go on, hit me!

674
36:03.760 --> 36:04.920
It hurts like hell...

675
36:13.620 --> 36:14.049
(Virtue Shines)

676
36:14.091 --> 36:16.211
(Yan Shang's been in the Yintaimen for two hours.)

677
36:19.590 --> 36:20.150
(Now,)

678
36:21.280 --> 36:23.030
(if there's any chance of saving him,)

679
36:24.440 --> 36:25.590
(only Father can help.)

680
36:26.360 --> 36:26.840
(Your Highness.)

681
36:27.440 --> 36:28.590
(Remember, patience.)

682
36:29.510 --> 36:30.190
(That python)

683
36:31.030 --> 36:32.150
(has yet to bare its fangs.)

684
36:34.280 --> 36:36.070
(If I were trapped in that python's jaws,)

685
36:36.840 --> 36:37.590
(I could endure it.)

686
36:38.510 --> 36:39.190
(But Yan Shang...)

687
36:39.960 --> 36:41.510
(Now you're the one)

688
36:42.030 --> 36:42.840
(caught in its jaws.)

689
36:48.760 --> 36:50.259
Since I ascended the throne,

690
36:50.301 --> 36:52.821
I've pardoned only three people.

691
36:53.590 --> 36:56.960
And all three had achieved extraordinary feats.

692
36:58.320 --> 37:00.150
What has Yan Shang done?

693
37:00.920 --> 37:01.710
He killed Zheng Xing,

694
37:02.400 --> 37:03.710
saving countless lives.

695
37:04.230 --> 37:04.960
It was a righteous deed.

696
37:08.510 --> 37:10.280
The sages punish the wicked,

697
37:11.280 --> 37:12.230
save lives and restore order,

698
37:12.670 --> 37:13.840
and must resort to punishment

699
37:14.400 --> 37:15.510
to bring peace to the realm.

700
37:16.230 --> 37:17.320
Yan Shang may not be a sage,

701
37:18.440 --> 37:19.440
but he's a good man.

702
37:21.840 --> 37:23.440
There are plenty of good men.

703
37:25.360 --> 37:25.710
Wanyao,

704
37:26.440 --> 37:27.590
tell me the truth.

705
37:28.440 --> 37:31.320
Why make an exception for this man?

706
37:35.550 --> 37:36.190
You must understand,

707
37:36.630 --> 37:38.030
once I issue this pardon,

708
37:38.800 --> 37:39.630
Yu Cheng'an will come here

709
37:40.360 --> 37:41.230
in no time

710
37:42.710 --> 37:45.230
and demand an explanation.

711
37:46.550 --> 37:47.230
Don't kneel.

712
37:49.070 --> 37:49.630
I understand.

713
37:51.320 --> 37:52.480
I've let you down.

714
37:52.820 --> 37:56.100
(Universe in Harmony)

715
37:56.190 --> 37:56.710
Rise.

716
38:01.070 --> 38:03.360
Now tell me why.

717
38:04.440 --> 38:07.360
Even if I issue a hundred pardons

718
38:07.440 --> 38:08.590
to help you,

719
38:09.480 --> 38:11.630
Yu Cheng'an wouldn't dare kill me.

720
38:13.480 --> 38:14.280
All these years,

721
38:15.800 --> 38:17.440
I've endured his oppression.

722
38:17.880 --> 38:19.000
So this is no big deal.

723
38:20.320 --> 38:23.030
I need to know why.

724
38:24.630 --> 38:26.070
What makes him so special?

725
38:27.480 --> 38:28.190
So special that,

726
38:29.630 --> 38:30.819
even knowing the consequences,

727
38:30.861 --> 38:33.091
you'd still beg me to save him?

728
38:36.920 --> 38:38.000
He's taking the blame for me.

729
38:39.760 --> 38:40.880
I killed Zheng Xing.

730
38:45.360 --> 38:46.550
I see.

731
38:50.360 --> 38:51.590
His actions make sense.

732
38:52.550 --> 38:54.070
No wonder you'd risk everything

733
38:54.920 --> 38:55.960
to clear his name.

734
38:57.480 --> 38:58.400
Please spare him, Father.

735
39:01.360 --> 39:01.960
Get up.

736
39:06.000 --> 39:08.320
Did he take the blame for you willingly?

737
39:08.880 --> 39:09.280
Yes.

738
39:11.110 --> 39:11.960
That explains it.

739
39:13.030 --> 39:14.440
His actions are understandable,

740
39:14.630 --> 39:15.400
but that doesn't mean

741
39:15.880 --> 39:17.070
his plight deserves sympathy.

742
39:17.360 --> 39:17.960
Father!

743
39:20.150 --> 39:20.800
Wanyao,

744
39:21.550 --> 39:22.840
you're so determined to protect him.

745
39:26.760 --> 39:28.510
Is it guilt,

746
39:29.440 --> 39:30.760
or do you have feelings for him?

747
39:32.670 --> 39:33.550
I feel guilty.

748
39:35.590 --> 39:36.550
I've let you down.

749
39:40.590 --> 39:43.030
If he's the man you love,

750
39:43.510 --> 39:44.960
I'll issue the pardon right now.

751
39:46.320 --> 39:48.070
But if he's merely your benefactor,

752
39:49.280 --> 39:51.230
I'll see that he gets a proper burial.

753
39:57.550 --> 39:58.510
Gratitude or love,

754
39:59.880 --> 40:00.760
how can I tell them apart?

755
40:03.920 --> 40:04.440
Father,

756
40:07.400 --> 40:08.760
Yan Shang has the talent to save our state.

757
40:10.150 --> 40:11.190
Why not spare his life

758
40:11.960 --> 40:13.030
so he will advise the court

759
40:13.480 --> 40:14.360
and serve our realm?

760
40:42.360 --> 40:45.360
(The circumstances invite leniency. Let leniency be shown.)

761
41:07.080 --> 41:09.660
(Grant him special pardon. Proclaim it far and wide, that all may know.)

762
41:11.510 --> 41:12.190
Thank you, Father!

763
41:13.070 --> 41:13.710
Rise.

764
41:21.710 --> 41:22.760
Go save him.

765
41:24.460 --> 41:27.900
(Universe in Harmony)

766
41:33.590 --> 41:36.280
Why didn't you tell Princess Danyang

767
41:37.230 --> 41:39.030
that the people you tried to save

768
41:39.480 --> 41:40.590
with your past three pardons

769
41:41.230 --> 41:44.400
all ended up unsaved?

770
41:47.670 --> 41:49.800
If Yu Cheng'an sees this pardon,

771
41:50.710 --> 41:53.150
Yan Shang is as good as dead.

772
41:56.630 --> 41:58.230
Since you think so highly of him,

773
41:59.400 --> 42:01.190
why not help him yourself?

774
42:02.000 --> 42:05.230
My pardon could be a death warrant.

775
42:05.670 --> 42:06.630
But you're different.

776
42:07.030 --> 42:08.070
Yu Cheng'an will

777
42:08.190 --> 42:11.280
still show you some respect.

778
42:12.440 --> 42:12.960
I'm not saving him.

779
42:15.150 --> 42:16.320
In Go,

780
42:17.400 --> 42:18.280
you first open a ko,

781
42:18.800 --> 42:19.590
then fight it,

782
42:20.360 --> 42:22.000
find a ko threat and answer it,

783
42:22.230 --> 42:23.150
then fight again.

784
42:24.070 --> 42:24.760
We've only

785
42:25.480 --> 42:26.800
just begun the ko fight.

786
42:27.920 --> 42:29.150
It's far too soon

787
42:29.800 --> 42:30.760
to settle it.

788
42:32.190 --> 42:34.110
If it dies now,

789
42:35.320 --> 42:37.590
it'll just be a useless stone.

790
42:38.550 --> 42:40.880
(Serene and Content) Young men lack foresight

791
42:42.000 --> 42:42.960
and lose their cool.

792
42:44.150 --> 42:45.630
They've already put themselves

793
42:47.030 --> 42:49.190
in a dead position.

794
42:55.480 --> 42:56.800
So how would you

795
42:57.510 --> 42:58.760
break out of it?

796
42:59.920 --> 43:01.280
The river of love is hard to cross.

797
43:02.590 --> 43:03.840
You must cross it yourself.

798
43:06.280 --> 43:07.089
A dead end...

799
43:07.131 --> 43:08.651
A dead end is hard to escape.

800
43:10.110 --> 43:11.190
Only you can save yourself.

801
43:32.230 --> 43:33.230
You've got a tough backbone.

802
43:34.440 --> 43:37.000
You actually survived a full day of whipping.

803
43:41.880 --> 43:44.320
Who ordered you to kill Mr. Zheng?

804
43:45.070 --> 43:45.550
Speak!

805
43:56.760 --> 43:59.510
Was it the Crown Prince?

806
44:15.320 --> 44:16.320
I want to see...

807
44:17.510 --> 44:18.360
Lord Yu.

808
44:18.760 --> 44:21.400
You can just demand to see Lord Yu, huh?

809
44:23.280 --> 44:24.819
I'd advise you to talk now

810
44:24.861 --> 44:25.861
and spare yourself some pain.

811
44:26.590 --> 44:28.920
You might even keep your body intact.

812
44:30.590 --> 44:32.510
I have a secret to report to Lord Yu.

813
44:38.320 --> 44:39.510
If you delay something important,

814
44:41.190 --> 44:42.670
can you bear the consequences?

815
44:44.110 --> 44:45.800
If this weren't top secret,

816
44:46.960 --> 44:47.920
why would Princess Danyang

817
44:48.840 --> 44:50.670
go to such lengths to protect me?

818
44:52.630 --> 44:55.030
I must see Lord Yu at once.

819
44:56.920 --> 44:58.550
If you dare deceive me...

820
44:59.230 --> 45:00.760
(Lord Yu has arrived!)

821
45:15.340 --> 45:19.940
(Next Episode Preview)

822
45:26.800 --> 45:28.800
Imperial Physician Huang, what's happening?

823
45:29.400 --> 45:30.819
She most likely took

824
45:30.861 --> 45:32.691
some dangerous medicine to end her pregnancy.

825
45:32.960 --> 45:33.710
Right now,

826
45:34.070 --> 45:35.000
her condition is critical.

827
45:37.040 --> 45:40.333
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

828
45:43.018 --> 45:47.934
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

829
45:50.128 --> 45:55.973
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

830
45:56.473 --> 46:01.699
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

831
46:04.468 --> 46:09.259
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

832
46:10.095 --> 46:16.174
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

833
46:17.975 --> 46:21.125
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

834
46:21.125 --> 46:22.773
♪Burning bright as a song♪

835
46:22.825 --> 46:26.549
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

836
46:26.927 --> 46:31.593
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

837
46:32.212 --> 46:36.253
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

838
46:36.744 --> 46:38.859
♪Not a single hour less♪

839
46:38.899 --> 46:45.845
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

840
46:46.608 --> 46:50.061
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

841
46:50.241 --> 46:53.386
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

842
46:53.825 --> 47:00.462
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

843
47:00.859 --> 47:02.897
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

844
47:02.897 --> 47:05.373
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

845
47:05.411 --> 47:07.880
♪You're the only one I need♪

846
47:08.084 --> 47:14.971
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

847
47:15.283 --> 47:18.554
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

848
47:18.859 --> 47:22.032
♪My last untouched innocence♪

849
47:22.356 --> 47:25.782
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

850
47:26.015 --> 47:29.240
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

851
47:29.571 --> 47:36.367
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

852
47:36.736 --> 47:38.798
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

853
47:38.799 --> 47:41.302
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

854
47:41.349 --> 47:43.687
♪You're the only one I need♪

855
47:43.918 --> 47:50.753
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

856
47:51.102 --> 47:52.720
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

857
47:52.850 --> 47:54.646
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

858
47:55.003 --> 47:58.020
♪You're the only one I need♪

859
47:58.060 --> 47:59.387
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
